flowchart TB
    accTitle: Local application delivery through a veth pair
    accDescr: Within one host namespace, devmap sends one copy to the network and one to a local veth pair. The receiving peer rewrites a local unicast MAC and returns XDP_PASS, allowing delivery to a local UDP socket.
    incoming["Incoming frame"] --> ingress
    subgraph host["One host / network namespace"]
        ingress["eth0<br/>ingress XDP"] --> group["DEVMAP broadcast"]
        group --> networkTX["eth1<br/>devmap transmit"]
        group --> hostTX["host_tx"]
        subgraph pair["Local veth pair"]
            hostTX --> hostRX["host_rx / ingress XDP<br/>rewrite dst MAC / XDP_PASS"]
        end
        hostRX --> stack["Build skb<br/>IP stack"]
        stack --> app["Local UDP socket<br/>interface: host_rx"]
    end
    networkTX --> peers["Network peers"]
    classDef forwarding fill:#eff6ff,stroke:#2563eb,color:#172554;
    classDef local fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b;
    class ingress,group,networkTX,peers forwarding;
    class hostTX,hostRX,stack,app local;
